    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762690/extras/ec6c195b2a95a67fee24b1a2acd446c5.avif?t=1752537642\" data-has-big width=800 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Those Who Dwell</i> is a first-person claustrophobic folk horror game  set in a dark, twisted labyrinth beneath the earth about isolation, light, and long forgotten things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in a excavation site deep beneath the earth. The team that once worked here is gone \u2014 and something older has been discovered and awakened. Navigate a network of twisting tunnels, ancient chambers, and abandoned dig sites as you piece together the fate of the excavators\u2026 and what they disturbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay in the light.</strong> Oil is scarce. Light fades. Some things only move when it\u2019s dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore lost shrines</strong> to push back the gloom and earn the favor of the Hidden Folk, if they still watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling. </strong>Discover cave paintings, tools, and old maps that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric slow-burn horror with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-based resource survival: manage oil, candles, and visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrine interaction system: restore, ignore, or desecrate \u2014 your choices change the outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden endings and secrets for those who explore thoroughly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 handcrafted levels, each with evolving environmental storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an in-progress version of the game. Some features or polish may not be final. Content will continue to be updated leading up to full release.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762690/extras/ec6c195b2a95a67fee24b1a2acd446c5.avif?t=1752537642\" data-has-big width=800 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Those Who Dwell</i> is a first-person claustrophobic folk horror game  set in a dark, twisted labyrinth beneath the earth about isolation, light, and long forgotten things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in a excavation site deep beneath the earth. The team that once worked here is gone \u2014 and something older has been discovered and awakened. Navigate a network of twisting tunnels, ancient chambers, and abandoned dig sites as you piece together the fate of the excavators\u2026 and what they disturbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay in the light.</strong> Oil is scarce. Light fades. Some things only move when it\u2019s dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore lost shrines</strong> to push back the gloom and earn the favor of the Hidden Folk, if they still watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling. </strong>Discover cave paintings, tools, and old maps that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric slow-burn horror with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-based resource survival: manage oil, candles, and visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrine interaction system: restore, ignore, or desecrate \u2014 your choices change the outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden endings and secrets for those who explore thoroughly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 handcrafted levels, each with evolving environmental storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an in-progress version of the game. Some features or polish may not be final. Content will continue to be updated leading up to full release.</p>",
    "short_description": "A slow-burning claustrophobic folk horror set deep underground. Light is your only hope as you explore deeper into a cursed cave system disturbed by those who dug too deep. Restore shrines, survive the dark, and uncover what became of Those Who Dwell.",
